  QUERY ID: py/empty-except
  SEVERITY: Recommendation
  PRECISION: High
  CWE: CWE-390 (Detection of Error Condition Without Action)
  WHAT IT FLAGS: Empty except blocks — exception handlers with no implementation (pass).
    "Ignoring exceptions that should be dealt with in some way is almost always a bad idea."
  EXAMPLE:
    try: security_manager.drop_privileges()
    except SecurityError: pass  # privilege drop failure silently ignored!
  FLOW PROPERTY: Structural/syntactic — checks whether except body contains only pass.
    No CFG needed for basic detection. For full "no logging or re-raise on any path"
    detection, would require CFG analysis of handler body.
  CLASSIFICATION: AST-LINT (syntactic: pass in handler body)
  NOTE: This detects the exact same pattern as bandit B110, but in CodeQL's framework
    with better context about WHY it's a security concern.
  TOOLS: CodeQL (py/empty-except), bandit (B110), pylint (W0702/W0703),
    ruff (BLE001, E722)
<<<END>>>

